title: Brand page on an untrusted host
severity: high
score: 45
tags: phishing, brand-impersonation
attack: T1656, T1583.001
description: A page presents a known brand (confidence 40 or more: the brand in the title,
  or its name throughout the text) on a host that vouches for nothing: a free hosting
  tenant, a heavily abused TLD, a bare IP address or a domain registered less than 90
  days ago. The brand does not own the host. The page need not ask for anything yet:
  lures often show only a button that leads to the sign-in.
---
// The brand pages (brand_claims) on a host in untrusted_hosts (hosting/_shared.kql).
brand_claims
| where confidence >= 40
| where host in (untrusted_hosts | project host)
| project brand, confidence, host, url = substring(url, 0, 300), evidence
| take 5
